@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@layerId = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439088

### 01. 준비: 201 (테스트 전용 ID 사용)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/layers
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"{{layerId}}","data":{"layer_id":"demo","layer_desc":"","mark_ups":[{"mark_up_id":1,"mark_up_name":"first"}],"tag":{"tag_idx":"tag1","tag_desc":"before"}}}

### 02. 중첩 속성, 배열 요소 수정 및 끝에 추가: 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/layers/{{layerId}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  {"op":"replace","path":"/data/tag/tag_desc","value":"변경된 설명"},
  {"op":"replace","path":"/data/mark_ups/0/mark_up_name","value":"첫 항목 수정"},
  {"op":"add","path":"/data/mark_ups/-","value":{"mark_up_id":2,"mark_up_name":"추가"}}
]

### 03. 기대한 항목인지 확인한 후 삭제: 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/layers/{{layerId}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  {"op":"test","path":"/data/mark_ups/0/mark_up_id","value":1},
  {"op":"remove","path":"/data/mark_ups/0"}
]

### 04. 실패 시 앞선 변경도 저장하지 않음: 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/layers/{{layerId}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  {"op":"replace","path":"/data/layer_desc","value":"저장되면 안 됨"},
  {"op":"remove","path":"/data/mark_ups/999"}
]

### 05. 조회: layer_desc는 기존 빈 문자열 유지
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/layers/{{layerId}}

### 06. 정리: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/layers/{{layerId}}
